     A          R HMNUREC
     A                                  1  2'Help - Main menu'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Type the number of an option and p-
     A                                      ress Enter.'
     A                                  4  3'You can also put the cursor on a l-
     A                                      ine and press Enter to pick it.'
     A                                  6  3' 1  Calendar: appointments, meetin-
     A                                      gs, rooms, holidays and shared cale-
     A                                      ndars.'
     A                                  7  3' 2  Mail, messages and chat: a men-
     A                                      u of the three ways to reach people-
     A                                      .'
     A                                  8  3' 3  Notes, tasks and phone book: a-
     A                                       menu of your own organizer.'
     A                                  9  3' 4  Documents and spreadsheets, an-
     A                                      d the printed output they make.'
     A                                 10  3' 5  Search everything: one search -
     A                                      across all of your office items.'
     A                                 11  3' 6  Office directory: who is enrol-
     A                                      led.'
     A                                 12  3' 7  Games and the office cat.'
     A                                 13  3' 8  Printed output: everything you-
     A                                       printed with a Print key.'
     A                                 14  3' 9  My profile: your name, phone a-
     A                                      nd pop-up messages.'
     A                                 15  3'10  Administration: for office adm-
     A                                      inistrators only.'
     A                                 17  3'The counts beside the options show-
     A                                       what is waiting for you.'
     A                                 18  3'F3 or 90 leaves the office.  F5 re-
     A                                      freshes the counts.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HPROF
     A                                  1  2'Help - My profile'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Your name, department and phone ar-
     A                                      e shown to other users in the offic-
     A                                      e'
     A                                  4  3'directory and in the list that F4 -
     A                                      opens when they address a message.'
     A                                  6  3'Pop-up messages: Y makes reminders-
     A                                      , new mail and chat requests appear-
     A                                       on'
     A                                  7  3'your screen as soon as they arrive-
     A                                      .  N lets them wait quietly in your'
     A                                  8  3'message queue, with the message li-
     A                                      ght on.  Leave it blank to keep the'
     A                                  9  3'present setting.'
     A                                 11  3'Change any field and press Enter t-
     A                                      o save.  F12 leaves without saving.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HSUBM
     A                                  1  2'Help - Menu'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Type the number of an option and p-
     A                                      ress Enter, or put the cursor on it'
     A                                  4  3'and press Enter.'
     A                                  6  3'The counts show new mail and messa-
     A                                      ges, and open tasks.'
     A                                  7  3'F12 goes back to the main menu.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
